{"seq":2,"slug":"synthesis-vs-samples","title":"合成与采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/foundations/synthesis-vs-samples","wordCount":1612,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"合成与采样\">合成与采样</h1><p>把&quot;合成好还是采样好&quot;当成一个非此即彼的辩题，是新手最常踩的坑。它们是两种在不同维度上各有强弱的工具，正确的问题是&quot;对这个具体声音，五个维度上哪条路线的综合得分更高&quot;。这一篇就把那五个维度——内存、变化度、可控性、CPU、可预测性——逐一拆开量化，给你一把能对任意声音打分的尺子。上一篇<a href=\"why-procedural-audio\">为何程序化音频</a>论证了走合成的动机，这一篇负责告诉你动机在哪些场景下会被反向推翻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这一篇的出发点是两条路线的本质差异：<strong>采样是回放一段被冻结的结果，合成是运行时求解一段过程</strong>。由这个差异展开出五个可量化的工程维度——内存、变化度、可控性、CPU、可预测性——以及它们背后的核心结论：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>五维打分</strong>：合成只在内存与变化度两维占优，在可控性、CPU、可预测性三维落后，所以默认选项其实是采样。</li>\n<li><strong>内存交叉点</strong>：采样内存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_0 n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 随变体数线性上升，合成内存近似常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{*}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处相交。</li>\n<li><strong>离散 vs 连续</strong>：采样只能把连续变化切档近似，合成因参数连续而输出连续。</li>\n<li><strong>护城河与负债</strong>：可控性与可预测性是采样的护城河；CPU 是合成必须偿还的负债。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"五个维度的能力对照\">五个维度的能力对照</h2><p>采样的本质是&quot;回放一段被冻结的结果&quot;，合成的本质是&quot;运行时求解一段过程&quot;。这个根本差异在五个工程维度上展开成下表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>采样</th>\n<th>合成</th>\n<th>谁赢</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td>随变体数线性增长</td>\n<td>近乎恒定（几 KB 系数）</td>\n<td>合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变化度</td>\n<td>离散、有限（轮播池）</td>\n<td>连续、无限（参数空间）</td>\n<td>合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可控性</td>\n<td>高：导演要啥是啥</td>\n<td>中：依赖参数调校</td>\n<td>采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td>极低：仅解码混音</td>\n<td>高：每帧实时求解</td>\n<td>采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可预测性</td>\n<td>完美：每次完全一致</td>\n<td>较低：随机微扰难复现</td>\n<td>采样</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表解释了一个反直觉的事实：合成只在两个维度（内存、变化度）压倒采样，却在三个维度上落后。所以默认选项其实是采样——只有当某声音对内存或变化度的需求强到压过其它三项时，才值得上合成。武器、车辆、环境纹理这类&quot;高频次、高变化、低单条价值&quot;的声音正是如此。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存与变化度-合成的主场\">内存与变化度：合成的主场</h2><p>把内存成本写成变体数的函数，两条路线的曲线形状截然不同。采样内存随所需变体数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 线性上升，合成内存则与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 几乎无关：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>sample</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>synth</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{sample}}(n) = m_0 \\cdot n, \\qquad M_{\\text{synth}}(n) \\approx c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sample</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">synth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单条素材的内存占用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是合成模型的常数系数开销。两条曲线在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{*}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处相交，超过它合成就更省内存。下面的图刻画了从单个声音请求到&quot;该走哪条路&quot;的判断流：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  START[一个声音需求] --&gt; V{需要的变体数 n?}&#10;  V --&gt;|n 小且固定&lt;br/&gt;如招牌音| SAMP[采样占优&lt;br/&gt;内存可控+可预测]&#10;  V --&gt;|n 大或连续&lt;br/&gt;如脚步/引擎| MEM{内存预算紧吗?}&#10;  MEM --&gt;|紧| SYN[合成占优&lt;br/&gt;内存恒定]&#10;  MEM --&gt;|宽松| CPU{CPU 预算够吗?}&#10;  CPU --&gt;|够| SYN&#10;  CPU --&gt;|不够| HYB[混合: 少量采样&lt;br/&gt;+ 参数微扰]&#10;  SAMP --&gt; DONE[定方案]&#10;  SYN --&gt; DONE&#10;  HYB --&gt; DONE\">flowchart TD\n  START[一个声音需求] --&gt; V{需要的变体数 n?}\n  V --&gt;|n 小且固定&lt;br/&gt;如招牌音| SAMP[采样占优&lt;br/&gt;内存可控+可预测]\n  V --&gt;|n 大或连续&lt;br/&gt;如脚步/引擎| MEM{内存预算紧吗?}\n  MEM --&gt;|紧| SYN[合成占优&lt;br/&gt;内存恒定]\n  MEM --&gt;|宽松| CPU{CPU 预算够吗?}\n  CPU --&gt;|够| SYN\n  CPU --&gt;|不够| HYB[混合: 少量采样&lt;br/&gt;+ 参数微扰]\n  SAMP --&gt; DONE[定方案]\n  SYN --&gt; DONE\n  HYB --&gt; DONE</pre><p>变化度上，采样的离散本质决定了它永远在&quot;逼近&quot;连续变化。一发子弹随距离从 5 米到 500 米，音色其实是连续渐变的，采样只能切成几档近似，档与档之间会有听感跳变。合成因为参数本身连续，输出也天然连续——这正是物理来源声音（碰撞、引擎、风）适合用<a href=\"../synthesis/physical-modeling\">物理建模合成</a>的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可控性与可预测性-采样的护城河\">可控性与可预测性：采样的护城河</h2><p>可控性是采样最难被替代的优势。当导演说&quot;这把主武器要听起来更厚、更有金属余韵&quot;，音效师在 DAW 里精修一条采样，所见即所得；而合成要调出同等质感，得反复试探参数空间，且未必收敛到那个&quot;对&quot;的声音。招牌音色（标志性武器、关键过场）几乎总是采样，因为它们承载品牌识别度，容不得程序化的不确定性。</p>\n<p>可预测性则关乎调试与一致性。采样每次播放完全相同，QA 能稳定复现 bug；合成带随机微扰，&quot;上次那个怪声音&quot;可能再也复现不出来。对竞技类游戏，声音还可能影响公平性——脚步方位若因合成抖动而不一致，是不可接受的。这类对一致性敏感的声音应固定随机种子或干脆用采样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cpu-合成必须背的债\">CPU：合成必须背的债</h2><p>合成的 CPU 成本是它无法回避的负债。一个采样声部基本只花解码与混音的开销，而一个合成声部每帧都要跑完整的信号处理链；<a href=\"../synthesis/granular-synthesis\">颗粒合成</a>在高密度时甚至要同时调度成百上千个微粒，<a href=\"../synthesis/subtractive-additive\">加法合成</a>叠加大量正弦分量时也成本高昂。这意味着同样的声部预算，合成能并发的声音数远少于采样。</p>\n<p>应对之道有三：一是缓存——把不随帧变化的中间结果（如固定材质的模态系数）预算一次复用；二是细节层级（LOD）——远处或不重要的声音降级到更便宜的合成或退回采样；三是声部上限——给合成声部设硬预算，超出就降级或剔除。这套方法论是实践章<a href=\"../practice/procedural-audio-performance\">性能与预算</a>的完整主题，此处只点明它是合成的&quot;隐形价签&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合成 vs 采样不是二选一，而是在<strong>内存、变化度、可控性、CPU、可预测性</strong>五维上各自打分。</li>\n<li>合成只在内存与变化度两维占优，其余三维落后——所以<strong>默认是采样</strong>，合成是被特定需求触发的选择。</li>\n<li>内存成本：采样随变体线性增长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_0 n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，合成近乎恒定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{*}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处交叉。</li>\n<li>可控性与可预测性是采样的护城河，招牌音色与竞技敏感音应留给采样。</li>\n<li>CPU 是合成的硬负债，靠缓存、LOD、声部上限来还。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>决策的连续谱：<a href=\"procedural-audio-spectrum\">程序化音频光谱</a></li>\n<li>物理来源声音为何适合合成：<a href=\"../synthesis/physical-modeling\">物理建模合成</a></li>\n<li>CPU 负债的偿还：<a href=\"../practice/procedural-audio-performance\">性能与预算</a></li>\n<li>采样工作流细节（本 hub 不展开）：<code>08_game-audio</code> 的<a href=\"../../game-audio/sound-design/synthesis-sampling\">合成与采样</a></li>\n<li>平行的&quot;过程 vs 回放&quot;取舍：<code>50_game-procedural-animation</code> 的<a href=\"../../game-procedural-animation/foundations/why-procedural-animation\">为何程序化动画</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合成与采样","id":"合成与采样"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"五个维度的能力对照","id":"五个维度的能力对照"},{"level":2,"text":"内存与变化度：合成的主场","id":"内存与变化度-合成的主场"},{"level":2,"text":"可控性与可预测性：采样的护城河","id":"可控性与可预测性-采样的护城河"},{"level":2,"text":"CPU：合成必须背的债","id":"cpu-合成必须背的债"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"为何程序化音频","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/foundations/why-procedural-audio"},"next":{"title":"程序化音频光谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/foundations/procedural-audio-spectrum"}}